get.description:
Gets a patient's family members who are also patients as an array of
  maps of form {:first-name 'Bob' :last-name 'Dobalina' :email 'a@b.c'};
  the family is filtered using the `-filter-family` function above

post.description:
Validates the supplied emails with mailgun. Payload is of form
  [{:email "email1@domain.com" :valid true}
   {:email "e@b.cd"            :valid false}]
